  "description": "ROCGAU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H70 Dy4 N6 O20,C3 H7 N1 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.443-3.859 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.07-110.94°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(L)4(O)2(DMF)2(ACP)2]·DMF.",
